{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S01、S02、S04等段的感受词明显偏密，尤其S01只有19秒，容易让观众来不及消化；X的双栏排法更清爽。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把心理变化拆得更清楚，重点词高亮让观众即使不逐字阅读，也能抓住每段的核心；从害怕成为负担、逐渐获得接纳、敢于喜欢，到害怕失去、最终接受不确定，前后推进更完整。尤其音乐感受不只是情绪标签，还能对应具体的旋律起伏、力度变化和心理反应，例如上涌却没有冲向高潮、回落后又漂起来，细腻程度明显胜过X。X的优势是清爽、易扫，但部分音乐细节和心理转折被压缩了。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "988b93d9-d1b1-4f29-947a-d54d2c3a18cb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T231900822458Z", "elapsed_seconds": 93.64, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:20:34.468206+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7c7f6952d5d0b3747ad2ecc4a6b48633b56619b664f107e0faa80fbd7aa14e3f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gp